  <p>For example, FlavorDraft may help you turn information from a recipe webpage, cooking video, social post, your own notes, or another supported source into ingredients and cooking steps stored in your personal cookbook.</p>
  <p>FlavorDraft is intended to make recipe note-taking and organization easier.</p>
</section>

